X *  History:     SCK  1.1  83/10/03  Created.
X *               SCK  1.2  84/11/29  Made it work.
X *               SCK  1.3  85/02/27  Tidied up for release.
X *               SCK  1.4  85/03/24  Changed the include files around.
X */
